'' 'sub f( ) static' MAKES EVERY LOCAL STATIC: 'dim n' counts 1 2 3 over three calls and a string
'' grows (fbc semantics). tiko swallowed the trailing STATIC and every call started over -- silently.
'' Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/static-proc-locals.bas -o tests/codegen/staticproclocals.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/staticproclocals.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  1 x
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  2 xx
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3 xxx
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  1             3             6
